  message: "Filed low-priority (P4, todo_soft) from the post-cutover PERMANENT-checklist audit (#9). Deliberately deferred: htrac-frontend is a private/unpublished BlockSuite frontend, not in CI, zero overlap with shipped Python wheels — so this is contained frontend hygiene, not a migration blocker and not soak-relevant. Fix is a self-contained npm bump in packages/htrac-frontend/ (26/27 patchable; alert #20 dompurify is no-fix) but needs a node toolchain + local build verification against the @blocksuite 0.17.33/vite 6 pins (no CI net). Pick up when there's bandwidth + local build access."  # 1926
